# .NET build output. 2026-07-29: these were `desktop/**/bin/` and `tools/**/bin/`,
# which is a trap in THIS repo — `bin/` is a SOURCE directory here (bin/helmion.mjs,
# bin/helmion-jobs.mjs and four more are tracked), so a future tool laid out the
# ordinary Node way as `tools/newtool/bin/cli.mjs` was silently untracked and one
# `git clean` from gone. Naming the MSBuild configurations instead keeps the
# ignore precise. `obj/` needs no such care — nothing but MSBuild writes it.
desktop/**/bin/Debug/
desktop/**/bin/Release/
desktop/**/obj/
tools/**/bin/Debug/
tools/**/bin/Release/
tools/**/obj/
# Catch a non-standard configuration name without swallowing a source bin/.
**/bin/*/net[0-9]*/
**/bin/x64/
**/bin/x86/
**/bin/AnyCPU/

# Local voice models (~470MB) - fetch with desktop/scripts/get-voice-models.ps1
desktop/models/
